# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Twinkle Twinkle Little Star|小星星
artist: Traditional|传统儿歌
bpm: 80
time: 4/4
level: 1
desc: Your first complete song! Only strings 1, 2 and 3: G = open string 3, A = string 3 fret 2, B = open string 2, C = string 2 fret 1, D = string 2 fret 3, E = open string 1.|第一首完整的歌! 只用 1、2、3 弦: G=3弦空弦 A=3弦2品 B=2弦空弦 C=2弦1品 D=2弦3品 E=1弦空弦.
desc: Tip: the last note of each phrase is a half note - let it ring for two full beats before the next phrase.|小贴士: 每句最后一个音是二分音符, 要让它响满两拍再弹下一句.
